{"event": "on_chat_model_stream", "data": {"chunk": {"content": "Contoh berikut adalah output lain yang dibuat dengan format yang sama persis. Studi kasus kali ini: penjelasan singkat alur autentikasi JWT pada aplikasi Spring Boot.\n\n", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {"safety_ratings": []}, "type": "AIMessageChunk", "name": null, "id": "run-b61d2c41-9f0a-4d9a-8c12-ff2b1a7e99aa", "example": false, "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": null, "tool_call_chunks": [], "divisi_type": ""}}, "run_id": "run-b61d2c41-9f0a-4d9a-8c12-ff2b1a7e99aa", "name": "ChatVertexAI", "tags": ["seq:step:2"], "metadata": {"ls_provider": null, "ls_model_name": null, "ls_model_type": null, "ls_temperature": null, "ls_max_tokens": null}, "parent_ids": ["b7d82e2a-5b0e-4f87-bcb3-12d9c4a0e111"]}
{"event": "on_chat_model_stream", "data": {"chunk": {"content": "1. User Login\nUser mengirim username dan password ke endpoint /auth/login.\nServer melakukan validasi credential ke database.\n\n", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {"safety_ratings": []}, "type": "AIMessageChunk", "name": null, "id": "run-b61d2c41-9f0a-4d9a-8c12-ff2b1a7e99aa", "example": false, "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": null, "tool_call_chunks": [], "divisi_type": ""}}, "run_id": "run-b61d2c41-9f0a-4d9a-8c12-ff2b1a7e99aa", "name": "ChatVertexAI", "tags": ["seq:step:2"], "metadata": {"ls_provider": null, "ls_model_name": null, "ls_model_type": null, "ls_temperature": null, "ls_max_tokens": null}, "parent_ids": ["b7d82e2a-5b0e-4f87-bcb3-12d9c4a0e111"]}
{"event": "on_chat_model_stream", "data": {"chunk": {"content": "2. Generate Token\nJika valid, server membuat JWT berisi userId, role, dan expiry time.\nToken ini ditandatangani dengan secret key.\n\n", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {"safety_ratings": []}, "type": "AIMessageChunk", "name": null, "id": "run-b61d2c41-9f0a-4d9a-8c12-ff2b1a7e99aa", "example": false, "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": null, "tool_call_chunks": [], "divisi_type": ""}}, "run_id": "run-b61d2c41-9f0a-4d9a-8c12-ff2b1a7e99aa", "name": "ChatVertexAI", "tags": ["seq:step:2"], "metadata": {"ls_provider": null, "ls_model_name": null, "ls_model_type": null, "ls_temperature": null, "ls_max_tokens": null}, "parent_ids": ["b7d82e2a-5b0e-4f87-bcb3-12d9c4a0e111"]}
{"event": "on_chat_model_stream", "data": {"chunk": {"content": "3. Akses Endpoint Terproteksi\nClient mengirim JWT di header Authorization: Bearer <token>.\nSpring Security filter memverifikasi token sebelum request diteruskan.\n\n", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {"safety_ratings": []}, "type": "AIMessageChunk", "name": null, "id": "run-b61d2c41-9f0a-4d9a-8c12-ff2b1a7e99aa", "example": false, "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": null, "tool_call_chunks": [], "divisi_type": ""}}, "run_id": "run-b61d2c41-9f0a-4d9a-8c12-ff2b1a7e99aa", "name": "ChatVertexAI", "tags": ["seq:step:2"], "metadata": {"ls_provider": null, "ls_model_name": null, "ls_model_type": null, "ls_temperature": null, "ls_max_tokens": null}, "parent_ids": ["b7d82e2a-5b0e-4f87-bcb3-12d9c4a0e111"]}
{"event": "on_chat_model_stream", "data": {"chunk": {"content": "4. Token Invalid / Expired\nJika token tidak valid atau expired, request dihentikan.\nServer mengembalikan response 401 Unauthorized.\n\nDengan alur ini, server tetap stateless dan scalable.\n", "additional_kwargs": {}, "response_metadata": {"safety_ratings": [], "finish_reason": "STOP", "grounding_metadata": {"retrieval_queries": [], "grounding_chunks": [], "grounding_supports": [], "web_search_queries": []}}, "type": "AIMessageChunk", "name": null, "id": "run-b61d2c41-9f0a-4d9a-8c12-ff2b1a7e99aa", "example": false, "tool_calls": [], "invalid_tool_calls": [], "usage_metadata": {"input_tokens": 380, "output_tokens": 260, "total_tokens": 640}, "tool_call_chunks": [], "divisi_type": ""}}, "run_id": "run-b61d2c41-9f0a-4d9a-8c12-ff2b1a7e99aa", "name": "ChatVertexAI", "tags": ["seq:step:2"], "metadata": {"ls_provider": null, "ls_model_name": null, "ls_model_type": null, "ls_temperature": null, "ls_max_tokens": null}, "parent_ids": ["b7d82e2a-5b0e-4f87-bcb3-12d9c4a0e111"]}
